OL,5,G0900 Sunday Morning
OL,6,     FPetroc Trelawny sits in for Sarah
OL,7,     FWalker with a Sunday mix featuring
OL,8,     FRenaissance choral music, operatic
OL,9,     Fdrama, and a colourful orchestral
OL,10,     Fjourney to the world of Aladdin.
OL,11,G1200 Private Passions
OL,12,     FMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,13,     Fformer Beatles hairdresser, Leslie
OL,14,     FCavendish.
OL,15,G1330 Music Map
OL,16,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch wends her way
OL,17,     Ftowards Brahms' melancholic late
OL,18,     Fmasterpiece. With swansongs from
OL,19,     FFaure and Mozart, there's also
OL,20,     Ftime for a spot of salon carousing
OL,21,     Fin Vienna.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
