OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: How to listen
OL,6,     F2/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,7,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,8,     Flistening. Today, Sakari takes us
OL,9,     Finside the listener's mind, and
OL,10,     Fexplores how context affects how
OL,11,     Fwe listen.
OL,12,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,13,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,14,     Fof all styles as requested by you.
OL,15,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,16,     FHannah French is live at the York
OL,17,     FFestival of Early Music.
OL,18,     FPerformances by lutenist Thomas
OL,19,     FDunford and the vocal ensemble
OL,20,     FContre Le Temps, who specialise in
OL,21,     FFrench medieval music.
